---
title: Property Management
lang: en
seoTitle: Odoo for Rental Property Management — Agitech
seoDescription: 'AgiRealEstate: rental property management on Odoo. Properties, leases, rent, unpaid rent, charges, profitability, claims — built by Agitech.'
blocks:
- discriminant: innerHero
  value:
    title: Our solution for the sector
    subTitle: Property Management
    bottomLine: true
    image: banner-bg-10.svg
- discriminant: caseIntro
  value:
    bgClass: lighter-gray-bg
    needsLabel: THE NEEDS
    needs:
    - Property & lease tracking
    - Automatic rent invoicing
    - Legal rent indexation
    - Profitability & portfolio tracking
    - Claims & incident management
    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p><strong>Lease tracking & deadlines:</strong> Without a centralized system, lease end dates, revisions and inventories of fixtures get lost in paper files or spreadsheets. A missed one is costly: rent not revised, notice missed.</p><p><strong>Manual rent invoicing:</strong> Generating each rent invoice by hand, month after month, for every property, takes a disproportionate amount of time and leaves room for errors and omissions.</p><p><strong>Rent indexation:</strong> Every lease has its own anniversary date and its own index reference. Calculating and applying indexation manually, property by property, is a recurring source of error.</p><p><strong>Invisible profitability:</strong> Without a unified dashboard, there''s no way to know in real time which properties are actually profitable once charges, loans and unpaid rent are factored in.</p><p><strong>Scattered claims and incidents:</strong> Without centralized tracking, every claim or technical incident is handled case by case, with no history and no link to the tenant or property involved.</p>'
- discriminant: odooExpertise
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
    title: Our solution for Property Management
    items:
    - logo: cloud-servers-icon.svg
      heading: Properties & buildings
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Create and track properties, grouped by building.</p><ul><li>Configurable document types: energy certificate, lease, inventory of fixtures...</li><li>Map view for properties, buildings, claims and incidents</li></ul>'
    - logo: Material-icon.svg
      heading: Leases & rent
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Monthly rent invoices generated automatically.</p><ul><li>Annual rent indexation on the lease anniversary (Belgian health index)</li><li>Electronic lease signature via Odoo Sign</li><li>Lease expiry alert (D-90)</li></ul>'
    - logo: monitoring-icon.svg
      heading: Unpaid rent & deposit
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Automatic reminders in case of non-payment.</p><ul><li>Rental deposit tracking: status, blocked account, refund</li></ul>'
    - logo: network-icon.svg
      heading: Charges & finances
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Dated and recurring charges (property tax prepayment, syndic fund call...).</p><ul><li>Loans with amortization schedule</li><li>Annual charge statement: provisions vs actual charges</li><li>Indexed cadastral income (official coefficients)</li></ul>'
    - logo: python-icon.svg
      heading: Profitability & portfolio
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Rental profitability tracking, gross and net.</p><ul><li>Portfolio dashboard: gross value, debts, net value</li><li>Monthly evolution, per property or per building</li></ul>'
    - logo: offer-icon.svg
      heading: Claims & incidents
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Claims and technical incident management per property.</p><ul><li>Incidents linked to Helpdesk tickets</li><li>Enriched tenant record: linked leases, currently rented property</li></ul>'
- discriminant: methodologies
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
    title: From property to profitability, in a single tool
    description: ''
    methodologies:
    - heading: Buildings & properties
      description: '<p>The portfolio is organised by building, with a complete record for each property.</p><ul><li>Ownership shares (thousandths), meters and EAN codes</li><li>Acquisition, indexed cadastral income, EPC, insurance</li><li>Profitability per property and consolidated per building</li></ul>'
    - heading: Tenants & leases
      description: '<p>A contact becomes a tenant as soon as they appear on a lease.</p><ul><li>Lease created and confirmed: the property automatically switches to "Rented"</li><li>Rental deposit tracked (paid, blocked, returned)</li><li>Tenant identification (national register, civil status)</li></ul>'
    - heading: Rent & arrears
      description: '<p>The month''s payment slips are generated as drafts, never sent by surprise.</p><ul><li>Batch validation and sending of rent calls in one click</li><li>Arrears tracking and payment slip as PDF</li><li>Standard Odoo accounting entries</li></ul>'
    - heading: Indexation & charges
      description: '<p>Repetitive calculations are automated.</p><ul><li>Yearly indexation on the health index, values imported automatically</li><li>Building charges split in proportion to ownership shares</li><li>Annual statement: provisions collected versus actual charges</li></ul>'
    - heading: Incidents & claims
      description: '<p>Every intervention keeps its history, linked to the property and the tenant.</p><ul><li>Take over, resolve, close</li><li>Insurance claim: amounts claimed and reimbursed</li><li>Helpdesk tickets linked to incidents</li></ul>'
    - heading: Portfolio & documents
      description: '<p>An overview to steer the portfolio.</p><ul><li>Gross assets, debts, net value and monthly evolution</li><li>Loans with amortisation schedule</li><li>Mandatory documents and alerts on missing items</li></ul>'
